<title>SWITZERLAND: Baxter sets pact with Immuno.</title>
<headline>Baxter sets pact with Immuno.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Baxter International Inc and Immuno International AG said in a joint statement their boards had agreed to cooperate in a worldwide strategic link.</p>
<p>The agreement will include the complete purchase of Immuno after three years.</p>
<p>The value of the transaction was put at about 850 million Swiss francs.</p>
<p>The transaction will require the approval of European and American cartell authorities, the firms said.</p>
</text>
